  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for POVE (PreOptimized Vault of Expressions)\n\t\n\n\n\nDataset accompanying the paper \"POVE: A Preoptimized Vault of Expressions for Symbolic Regression Research and Benchmarking\".\nMain/primary assets in optimized_data/.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEthics Statement\n\t\n\nThis paper presents work whose goal is to advance the field of Machine Learning. There are many potential societal and ethical consequences of our work, none which we feel must be specifically highlighted here.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ksfong/POVE.",
